      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01356",
      "en": "Oh, not so serious?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01357",
      "en": "And Levia works so hard.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01360",
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
