      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01363",
      "en": "I hope that doesn't backfire.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01366",
      "en": "What do you think of Levia and the others?",
      "notes": ""
