      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01374",
      "en": "No, I mean... Levia's impression in this town",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01375",
      "en": "doesn't seem good.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01378",
      "en": "Ah, right... are you worried?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01381",
      "en": "Something like that.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01384",
      "en": "Hehe, it's okay. There were some issues",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01385",
      "en": "at first, but Levia herself is popular",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01386",
      "en": "with the townspeople.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01389",
      "en": "Really?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01392",
      "en": "Yes, even with her title, she's polite to",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01393",
      "en": "everyone, and many people look up to her,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
