      "en": "especially the girls.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01397",
      "en": "I see...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01399",
      "en": "Since Levia became a general despite being a woman,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
